  ["PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6azUWe", "Fixed in c2d128c9 and strengthened in ce02d1f6. Outer transactions defer permission-directory work until database settlement; rollback compensation now uses a durable outbox task. Rollback regressions cover both share publication and unshare restoration."],
