  ["PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6azUic", "Fixed in 1bbfcb06 and ce02d1f6. Successful shares persist reconciliation work transactionally (or before the write on non-transaction adapters), retry with exponential backoff, and keep committed results stable when immediate draining fails."],
  ["PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6azUif", "Fixed in 58907420. Existing indexes are matched by name, normalized columns, and uniqueness; mismatches produce a drop/recreate migration. Tests cover the claim_token invariant."],
