  ["PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6a0rME", "Valid and already fixed on the current head. Push reconciliation catches post-commit drain failures, preserves the successful mutation result, then records idempotent success. The regression `keeps a committed push share successful when immediate outbox draining throws` remains green."],
